Subject: [PATCH] winemac/win32u/server: fullscreen/focus/Retina/display mode, IME, and RawInput active fallback

Consolidated patches:
  - (0017) winemac.drv: borderless fullscreen snap, activation foreground restore, Retina mask/mode sync, and Dock icon demotion
subj='winemac.drv: borderless fullscreen snap, activation foreground restore, Retina mask/mode sync, and Dock icon demotion'
  - (0031) 
subj=''
  - (0042) server,winemac.drv: RawInput active-window fallback and IME non-output passthrough

---
